# =========================================================
#  Production build configuration  (committed on purpose)
# =========================================================
#
#  Read by Vite when it builds in production mode, so the deployed
#  bundle no longer depends on environment variables being present in
#  the hosting dashboard.
#
#  ---------------------------------------------------------
#  Why it is safe to commit THESE values
#  ---------------------------------------------------------
#
#  Both are publishable by design. Vite substitutes every VITE_ value
#  into JavaScript that is downloaded by every visitor, so they are
#  already readable by anyone who opens the site and looks at the
#  bundle. Committing them changes who can see them: nobody new.
#
#  Supabase calls the second one the publishable (anon) key for this
#  reason. Its safety comes from Row Level Security on the database,
#  never from keeping the key hidden.
#
#  ---------------------------------------------------------
#  What must NEVER go in this file
#  ---------------------------------------------------------
#
#    * The Supabase SERVICE ROLE key. It bypasses Row Level Security.
#    * DATABASE_URL, or any database password.
#    * Razorpay secrets, or any webhook signing secret.
#
#  Those belong only in the hosting platform's environment variables.
#  A value with a VITE_ prefix is public, so a secret placed here is
#  published twice over: in the repository and in the bundle.
#
#  ---------------------------------------------------------
#  Precedence
#  ---------------------------------------------------------
#
#  Real environment variables set on the host override this file, so
#  adding these in the Vercel dashboard later takes effect without any
#  change here.
#
#  VITE_API_BASE_URL is deliberately absent. Unset, the app falls back
#  to /api/v1, which is correct when the API and the storefront share a
#  domain. Local development keeps its own value in .env, which points
#  at the API on port 8000.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://chdtmuddnqhvismofwip.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_86iQ8k_OmZl4LiLb5h3HQA_26uGUFql
